muse-bridge

The files under worker/bridge/muse/ (and the test responder logic they include) are
derived from the Muse Gadget SDK, facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk, at commit
e17081a, files linux/src/musegadget/noise/{noise_xx,framing,envelope,_proto,
transport}.py, linux/src/musegadget/streaming.py,
linux/src/musegadget/link_client.py and linux/src/musegadget/muse_api.py.

